/F1 10.5 Tf (CLINICAL STUDY PROTOCOL) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Protocol No. BCH-DH-2026-014) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Title: A Phase 2, Single-Arm, 12-Week Digital Health Study of Remote Electronic Patient-) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Reported Outcome \(ePRO\) Monitoring in Adults with Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus and Comorbid) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Hypertension) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Short Title: CARDIA-PRO) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Sponsor: Beacon Harbor Therapeutics, Inc. \(fictional\)) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Study Site: Beacon Harbor Clinical Research Unit, 200 Longwood Avenue, Boston, MA 02115 \(lat) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (42.3355, lng -71.1050\)) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Phase: 2) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Version: 1.0 \(synthetic protocol for demonstration; all content is fictional\)) '
/F1 10.5 Tf () '
/F2 10.5 Tf (1. SYNOPSIS) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Rationale. Adults with type 2 diabetes mellitus \(T2DM\) and hypertension carry a high burden) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (of cardiovascular risk, and between-visit self-management is poorly captured by routine) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (care. This study evaluates whether structured, voice-based ePRO survey calls improve) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (medication adherence and patient-reported wellbeing over 12 weeks compared with each) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (participant's own baseline.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Objectives. Primary: change from Baseline to Week 12 in glycated hemoglobin \(HbA1c\).) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Secondary: change in seated systolic blood pressure, change in PHQ-9 depression score,) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (change in EQ-5D-5L index, and medication adherence \(MMAS-8\) at Week 12.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Design. Open-label, single-arm, decentralized-hybrid study. Participants complete scheduled) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (ePRO survey calls and two in-clinic visits.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Sample size. Approximately 60 participants will be enrolled.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Duration. Each participant is followed for 84 days \(12 weeks\) after Baseline \(Day 0\), plus a) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (Screening period of up to 14 days.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf () '
/F2 10.5 Tf (2. STUDY POPULATION) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (2.1 Target conditions: type 2 diabetes mellitus; hypertension \(essential\). Participants with) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (prediabetes only are not eligible.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (2.2 Inclusion criteria) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   1. Adults aged 30 to 70 years inclusive at Screening.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   2. Male or female \(any sex\).) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   3. Documented diagnosis of type 2 diabetes mellitus for at least 6 months.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   4. Documented diagnosis of hypertension, on a stable antihypertensive regimen for at) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (      least 3 months.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   5. HbA1c between 7.0% and 10.5% at Screening.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   6. Resident within 80 km \(50 miles\) of the Boston study site, able to attend clinic) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (      visits at Week 6 and Week 12.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   7. Owns a mobile phone and agrees to receive automated telephone survey calls.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   8. Able to understand English and provide informed consent.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (2.3 Exclusion criteria) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   1. Type 1 diabetes or latent autoimmune diabetes in adults.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   2. Pregnancy or breastfeeding.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   3. History of myocardial infarction, stroke, or unstable angina within the past 6 months.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   4. Severe renal impairment \(eGFR below 30 mL/min/1.73 m2\) or dialysis.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (   5. Current active suicidal ideation \(PHQ-9 item 9 score of 2 or more\).) '
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 266.0 30 Td (Page 1 of 3) Tj ET
endstream
