/F1 10.5 Tf (value derived from a voice call must retain a verbatim evidence quote and call timestamp so) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (that a reviewer can verify it against the recording. Participant identifiers are replaced by) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (a study ID; phone numbers are stored separately from clinical data. Calls are recorded only) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (after verbal consent at the start of each call. Data handling follows ICH-GCP E6\(R2\) and 21) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (CFR Part 11 principles.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf () '
/F2 10.5 Tf (7. STATISTICAL CONSIDERATIONS) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (The primary analysis is a paired comparison of HbA1c at Week 12 versus Baseline in all) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (participants with at least one post-baseline measurement. A sample of 60 provides 90% power) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (to detect a 0.5 percentage-point reduction assuming a standard deviation of 1.0. Safety is) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (summarized descriptively.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf () '
/F2 10.5 Tf (8. ETHICS) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (This protocol is a synthetic example created for software demonstration. It describes no) '
/F1 10.5 Tf (real investigational product, sponsor, or study.) '
/F1 10.5 Tf () '
ET
